#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source Name           :   s_chqValmn002.scr
# Date                  :   18-03-2013
# Author                :   Shishira
# Title                 :   OutwardClearingValidation
# Description           :   Verify the input of HOCTM menu for Add function
# Sources called        :   NA
# Sources called from   :   SRV_LodgeOcSet_post_validate_data.scr
# RS Approach Document  :
# Modification History  :
# <Serial No.>      <Date>          <Author Name>       <Description>
